{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "302196e65c94efea715b2be6d6da1c2efaf05a32d62b0c056e2593d3a7282738", "ja": "深青書院にて", "zh": "在深青书院", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "26ec65bdef371490443e67e65b17b23866b5583bd2661bef21327525a26551a8", "ja": "千早は貴音に敗北を詫びる。次は自身が出る\n事になるだろうと話す貴音。一方、ロコは\n深青書院に潜入取材を試みるが、案の定、\n貴音に見つかる。改めて取材をしようとする\nが、警報システムに見つかり逃走する。", "zh": "千早向贵音道歉，表示败给了她。贵音则说，下次大概就要由自己出场了。另一方面，ROCO试图潜入深青书院进行采访，但果然被贵音发现了。她正准备重新进行采访，却被警报系统发现，只得逃走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "e3ae3a0b9bec4a05e3e8bdd0e38c607fa5ad4a0da361d4949edb45db76faa9ce", "ja": "深青書院　談話室……", "zh": "深青书院　谈话室……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "c35102f25466b3da9f738696cbe7623bf73437e8e71e35bf8d623c2f50343e12", "ja": "ごめんなさい、四条さん。\nまさか、戦具を持たない人間が存在するなんて。", "zh": "对不起，四条。\n没想到竟然会有不携带战具的人类存在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "6987ca161dc94ac6abaecb7360e6760d34e28c4cc10ebf5aaf36bfc2d0b61862", "ja": "謝らないでください、千早。最後まで\n情報を隠し通したあちらが、上手だっただけのこと。", "zh": "请不要道歉，千早。只是对方一直把情报隐瞒到最后，技高一筹罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "391655de877d625d468ca78d95141645533b20f5cdf5171af5e3bcbdacc656c5", "ja": "……。私が負けた以上、貴女にも出てもらうことに\nなるかもしれないわ。不本意なのだけれど。", "zh": "……。既然我输了，接下来可能就不得不\n由你出面了。虽然这并非我的本意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "14f9e2ef12770bd8f336f0fb034dd6c2fa116bd030a63be14d34a96f7ba1797c", "ja": "相手は、おそらく……ヘリオトロープ最強の\n生徒会長、二階堂千鶴ね。", "zh": "对手恐怕是……Heliotrope最强的学生会长，二阶堂千鹤吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "3a7398e85b7fdd542b55c00a53d4312f168d97fcad4a60839d37ebc471eb4e2d", "ja": "いい機会です。私とて、いつまでも守られて\nばかりではいられませんから……受けて立ちましょう。", "zh": "正好是个机会。我也不能总是\n一味地受到庇护……就让我应战吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1007_null", "source_sha256": "318e07ba4093b61e89c2ec75fc29b7f389c7636cd4cb60c251411bdc3486e3e0", "ja": "深青書院　裏庭……", "zh": "深青书院　后院……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "e250b99082554b705dd82210689f28c6455670cba4ebf7b87cde1b8b8b96c7f4", "ja": "……ふぅ、どうにか忍び込めましたね。\n深青書院はセキュリティがハードです……。", "zh": "……呼，总算潜入进来了呢。\n深青书院的安保真是森严啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "4d84ed70fc9b3b6f6376c21583c94b7cc2f0aae8bf5bbbf722b1cef44b00b20c", "ja": "ここには、失われたナレッジが保管されている\nそうですが……信ぴょう性がありますね。", "zh": "听说这里保管着失落的知识……看来消息很可靠。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1010_null", "source_sha256": "a8e4f5d1d2129194c19301b6881d7e1989032f71004170d2eaaca56f56a76f3f", "ja": "ザッ、ザッ……", "zh": "嚓、嚓……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "ca4e699e63cb8cc6ee9e47fddf390a4a58be1d5d8e6ff778bed297e2245df039", "ja": "だ、誰かいる……！？\n見つからないように、ビークワイエットです……！", "zh": "有、有人在……！？\n为了不被发现，要保持安静……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "9824e75bf4b99cc82e9d36f9c1d43f63081bcb91ea743c7943e9d366e8e71fdc", "ja": "……。私は、後何回、繰り返すのでしょう？\nいっそ、忘れられたら……。", "zh": "……我还要再重复多少次呢？\n要是干脆被忘记了……就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "ef1a51bc36f8f48d191b9f684ed267be71bb8a4631332edbba4d574c9da4e9bd", "ja": "あれは……タカネ！　院内の最高役職『司書』に\n就く、深青のVIP……！", "zh": "那是……贵音！担任院内最高职位“司书”的深青色VIP……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "c740822cc65a5e2c485e74e46f41ac28b0565fe983f536cf2c5c16eab737ad55", "ja": "モノローグ、よく聞き取れません……\n繰り返す？　忘れる……？　もう少し……", "zh": "独白，听不太清楚……\n再重复一遍？忘掉……？再多来一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1015_null", "source_sha256": "9365232c1adb7daa146cf76cb68cf45c270c7dc4d8e373aec4ed3e1aad571a8a", "ja": "パキッ", "zh": "啪嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "1a5a0ea24c0f0914c49df978c0de5b5f5bf7aad12fbc184ec55dd1dcf8410fd4", "ja": "……何者ですか？", "zh": "……是什么人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "e978ec303fb04c06ad380b624d1128ce6b60fd29dbbeaaf67d491a5614acc423", "ja": "あ、あわわ……ロコは、怪しい者じゃありません！\nその、ちょっと散歩をしていたと言うか……！", "zh": "啊、啊哇哇……ROCO不是可疑人物！\n那个，该说是在附近散了会儿步……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "fcd872781ef91272d67fa4c46c2d84ab044d24bbdd0b4780517e9f03d838074e", "ja": "このような場所で、散歩を？\nそうですか。しかし……見ない顔ですね？", "zh": "在这种地方散步？\n这样啊。不过……我没见过你呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "57e51708a7ab84c09cf2ffc2c59d8f3c9e6493664b42fe8eed97239347d25e89", "ja": "ええと……実はロコは、ヘリオトロープの新聞部\nなんです！　タカネに取材をしたくて……。", "zh": "呃……其实ROCO是Heliotrope新闻部的成员！我想采访贵音……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1020_008tak", "source_sha256": "f9d231d364bb5ad1675280e02ab8d06bd98aaa0b5ddeb0c9b2dcc6eab45af8d4", "ja": "取材……？　私に、ですか？", "zh": "采访……？是要采访我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1021_null", "source_sha256": "8199838be7ae8515a7471bc0a6113e9475bc9e4b09b69d7add597565c7ea23a1", "ja": "ビーッ、ビビーッ！\n侵入者ヲ検知！　侵入者ヲ検知！", "zh": "哔——，哔哔——！\n检测到入侵者！检测到入侵者！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1022_025roc", "source_sha256": "164bd82d53f800e58d7236b4d9e00ebc8ee13a516c064a505294e8247c9fd576", "ja": "し、しまった！　見つかった……うぅ～！\nタカネには、聞きたいことがいっぱいあるのに～！", "zh": "糟、糟糕！被发现了……呜呜～！\n明明还有好多事情想问贵音的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1023_008tak", "source_sha256": "c2d72df2ef1f3620733f4399435c46ff957b2121844e43c879d474bc7856730d", "ja": "怪しいものではないと言っていたのに……\n侵入者だったのですか？", "zh": "明明说过自己不是可疑人物……\n原来是入侵者吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "d4c5f1abb1fb5e28adde22a4fa87889a5137c8d2cfa90cd9d174141864a323bc", "ja": "いいえ！　確かに侵入者ですけど、\nロコは怪しいものではありません。シリアスです！", "zh": "不是！虽然确实是入侵者，但ROCO并不是什么可疑人物。是正经的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1025_002chi", "source_sha256": "de847d6f5eae898d629a17932a6720b91ff7d2288913d4d8dc51af44e781f421", "ja": "そこまでよ、伴田さん。\n四条さんから、すぐに離れなさい。さもないと……", "zh": "到此为止了，伴田小姐。请马上离开四条小姐。否则……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1026_025roc", "source_sha256": "eca85072e284d409929d4bcaa4772e4f77a138c98a8440cc9645dba582f3cde5", "ja": "チハヤ！？　くっ……これ以上の取材は\nディフィカルトですね。シーユーです、タカネ！", "zh": "千早！？唔……看来没法再继续采访了。再见，贵音！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1027_002chi", "source_sha256": "505611eba8ea77d6008a8d23b6e948f06ceca08c126d8cee465019dd8cd46957", "ja": "あっ……まったく、警備員は何をしているの？\nすぐに来てください、第七書庫の裏です……早く！", "zh": "啊……真是的，保安人员在做什么呢？\n请马上过来，在第七书库后面……快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1028_008tak", "source_sha256": "2120947dd9955a90fe33ffe41becf34a62692ae87b85ef40c52316cdc0cdea33", "ja": "……ふふっ。", "zh": "……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1029_002chi", "source_sha256": "51b65dd16ffa0e22491766ee8fcc472f007cc8849c7b9f296171ca05222d9219", "ja": "……四条さん？　どうしたの？\n笑いごとではないわ。", "zh": "……四条同学？怎么了？\n这可不是笑的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_02_1030_008tak", "source_sha256": "bc87d295d631ebc893d8188eeeb01e1ae7b0a7de35968d698a447f4d1d046f6c", "ja": "いえ、なんでも……。外の方と話すのは、\n久しぶりだったもので、つい……ふふっ。", "zh": "没什么……只是，好久没和外面的人说话了，一不小心就……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
